                                "example_id": "c4a38a01-90e0-4ad6-ae33-fe8a22dd929f",
                                "sense_id": "c54a61f4-b326-3872-ad5e-33df1d8d07ca",
                                "text": "“But my Pookie is so sick, I just couldn't wait any longer. I'm so worried, Doctor,” the woman interrupted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b99c1f38-c4e7-453b-836d-086acbf288b1",
                                "sense_id": "c54a61f4-b326-3872-ad5e-33df1d8d07ca",
                                "text": "“I just call him my Pookie.” She seemed uncomfortable as she moved away from me and slid to the couch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad02f6af-5546-4c67-82f7-63c0209f0e18",
                                "sense_id": "c54a61f4-b326-3872-ad5e-33df1d8d07ca",
                                "text": "“Pookie?” “Yeah.” “I'm Philly-bound. Will you pack me a chip-chop ham sandwich?”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
